## 2. Architecture & Design

### Target State Architecture

The AI Landing Zone operates alongside other core cloud capabilities within the broader Product Home and Enterprise Landing Zone. It leverages shared enterprise services — security, networking, privacy, compliance, and governance guardrails — ensuring all AI workloads are aligned to the organisation's risk, trust, and operational standards.

**Core layers:**

