## 3. Coles Agentic SDK

### What is the Coles Agentic SDK?

The **Coles Agentic SDK** is the recommended SDK surface for common, repeatable, governance-critical concerns when building MAF (Microsoft Agent Framework) and Azure AI Foundry–based use cases.

It wraps a deliberately scoped set of foundational concerns so product teams do not re-implement them per use case:

- Configuration loading
- Credential resolution
- Observability wiring
- Agent factories
- Control-plane prompt-agent publishing

It does **not** replace MAF orchestration or Foundry platform capabilities.

